<section class="hero">
  <h1>Support tickets, built into your Discord server.</h1>
  <p class="lead">EasySupport turns any Discord server into a help desk. Members open private tickets from a button panel; staff claim, escalate and close them with one click. Self-hosted on your own server alongside the bot, sharing a single database.</p>
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="<%= repoUrl %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on GitHub</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="features">
  <div class="card">
    <h3>One-click ticket creation</h3>
    <p>/panel posts a button per category. Members pick a topic, answer optional intake questions, and get a private channel instantly.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h3>Staff workflow panel</h3>
    <p>Every status &mdash; claim, pending, escalate, close &mdash; is a button on the ticket panel. Changes are atomic, so two staff can&rsquo;t claim the same ticket at once.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h3>Transcripts and ratings</h3>
    <p>On closure, users receive TXT and HTML transcripts plus a 1&ndash;5 star rating DM. Staff see closure stats per month.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h3>MySQL storage</h3>
    <p>Bot and website share a single MySQL database on one host. No separate bot process or extra infrastructure.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero { padding: 72px 0 48px; text-align: left; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: 2.75rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .hero .lead { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.1rem; max-width: 620px; margin-bottom: 26px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 12px; }
  .features { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 50px; }
  .card { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 24px; }
  .card h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 10px; color: var(--text); }
  .card p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
    .hero-actions { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
    .hero-actions .btn { justify-content: center; }
  }
</style>
